    <warning>
        <warning-info>
			
			
            <text type="warning_title">Minor Flood Warning for the Paroo River (NSW)</text>
            <text type="warning_subtitle"></text>
  	        
<text type="warning_advice">
<p>Don't drive, walk, swim or play in floodwater because it is dangerous.</p>
<p>Stay away from flooded drains, rivers, streams and waterways.</p>
<p>Obey road closure signs. Plan ahead so you don&#39;t drive on flooded roads.</p>
<p>Check the ABC and local media for updates. The situation can change quickly, so stay informed.</p>
<p>For local emergency management warnings and advice visit www.ses.nsw.gov.au.</p>
</text>
<text type="warning_advice_contact">
<p>For emergency assistance call SES on telephone number 132 500. In life-threatening emergencies, call 000 (triple zero) immediately.

</p>
</text>
            <text type="warning_next_issue">The next warning will be issued by 12:00 PM AEDT on Wednesday 04 November 2026.</text>
            <text type="product_footer">
<p>This advice is also available by dialling 1300 659 219. Warning, rainfall and river information are available at http://www.bom.gov.au/australia/flood.</p>
			</text>
        </warning-info>
