				<p>MINOR FLOODING LIKELY AT WILLARA CROSSING FROM EARLY WEDNESDAY MORNING</p>

				<p/>
				<p>The flood peak from rain over the previous week in the Paroo Catchment in Queensland is now around Hungerford. This is likely to cause minor flooding at Willara Crossing from early Wednesday morning.</p>

				<p/>

